      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If i may, but if considered promotion can be removed.\n\nAs a temporary somehow alternative, you can combine the following tools to achieve such result.\n\n- https://github.com/anatawa12/ContinuousAvatarUploader will allow you to upload your avatar (or even multiple of them) to multiple platforms (don't know if supports IOS yet)\n\n- https://github.com/kurotu/VRCQuestTools will allow you to make specific editions for the quest platform to adapt the avatar to that platform.\n\nIf it can help people in wait of this feature.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
